<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>롯데월드타워 건축 설계 과정 - claude-sonnet-4.5</title>
<style>
* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}

body {
  font-family: 'Malgun Gothic', sans-serif;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%);
  color: #e0e0e0;
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

.header {
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  padding: 1rem 2rem;
  text-align: center;
  border-bottom: 2px solid #0f4c75;
}

.header h1 {
  font-size: 1.8rem;
  color: #3fc1c9;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.header .model-info {
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  color: #aaa;
}

.container {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  grid-template-rows: auto 1fr;
  gap: 1rem;
  padding: 1rem;
  height: calc(100vh - 100px);
}

.section {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 1rem;
  overflow: auto;
  border: 1px solid rgba(63, 193, 201, 0.3);
}

.section h2 {
  color: #3fc1c9;
  font-size: 1.3rem;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
  border-bottom: 2px solid #0f4c75;
  padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.drawings {
  grid-column: 1;
  grid-row: 1;
}

.design-stages {
  grid-column: 2;
  grid-row: 1;
}

.model-viewer {
  grid-column: 1 / -1;
  grid-row: 2;
  position: relative;
}

canvas {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  display: block;
  border-radius: 8px;
}

.drawing-item {
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  padding: 1rem;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  border-radius: 6px;
  border-left: 4px solid #3fc1c9;
}

.drawing-item h3 {
  color: #3fc1c9;
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
}

.drawing-canvas {
  width: 100%;
  height: 200px;
  background: white;
  border-radius: 4px;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.drawing-info {
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: #bbb;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.stage-buttons {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.stage-btn {
  padding: 0.7rem 1.2rem;
  background: rgba(63, 193, 201, 0.2);
  border: 2px solid #3fc1c9;
  color: #3fc1c9;
  border-radius: 6px;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  transition: all 0.3s;
}

.stage-btn:hover {
  background: rgba(63, 193, 201, 0.4);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}

.stage-btn.active {
  background: #3fc1c9;
  color: #1a1a2e;
  font-weight: bold;
}

.stage-description {
  padding: 1rem;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  border-radius: 6px;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.controls {
  position: absolute;
  top: 1rem;
  right: 1rem;
  display: flex;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  z-index: 10;
}

.control-btn {
  padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
  background: rgba(63, 193, 201, 0.8);
  border: none;
  color: #1a1a2e;
  border-radius: 6px;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-weight: bold;
  transition: all 0.3s;
}

.control-btn:hover {
  background: #3fc1c9;
  transform: scale(1.05);
}

.legend {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 1rem;
  left: 1rem;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
  padding: 1rem;
  border-radius: 6px;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  max-width: 300px;
}

.legend-item {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.legend-color {
  width: 20px;
  height: 20px;
  border-radius: 3px;
  margin-right: 0.5rem;
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .container {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    grid-template-rows: auto auto 1fr;
  }

  .drawings {
    grid-column: 1;
    grid-row: 1;
  }

  .design-stages {
    grid-column: 1;
    grid-row: 2;
  }

  .model-viewer {
    grid-column: 1;
    grid-row: 3;
  }

  .header h1 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  * {
    animation: none !important;
    transition: none !important;
  }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="header">
  <h1>롯데월드타워 건축 설계 과정</h1>
  <div class="model-info">Generated by claude-sonnet-4.5 (us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929-v1:0)</div>
</div>

<div class="container">
  <div class="section drawings">
    <h2>설계 도면</h2>

    <div class="drawing-item">
      <h3>배치도 (Site Plan)</h3>
      <canvas class="drawing-canvas" id="sitePlan"></canvas>
      <div class="drawing-info">
        • 위치: 서울특별시 송파구 올림픽로 300<br>
        • 대지면積: 약 79,000㎡ (추정)<br>
        • 건폐율: 약 30% (추정)<br>
        • 주변 환경: 석촌호수, 롯데월드 어드벤처 인접
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="drawing-item">
      <h3>기준층 평면도 (Typical Floor Plan)</h3>
      <canvas class="drawing-canvas" id="floorPlan"></canvas>
      <div class="drawing-info">
        • 저층부 기준층 면적: 약 3,500㎡ (추정)<br>
        • 고층부 기준층 면적: 약 2,000㎡ (추정)<br>
        • 코어 위치: 중앙 집중형<br>
        • 외곽 형태: 곡선형 (한국 도자기 모티브)
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="drawing-item">
      <h3>입면도 (Elevation)</h3>
      <canvas class="drawing-canvas" id="elevation"></canvas>
      <div class="drawing-info">
        • 전체 높이: 555m<br>
        • 층수: 지상 123층, 지하 6층<br>
        • 형태: 상부로 갈수록 테이퍼링<br>
        • 외관: 유리 커튼월, 한국 도자기 곡선 반영
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="drawing-item">
      <h3>단면도 (Section)</h3>
      <canvas class="drawing-canvas" id="section"></canvas>
      <div class="drawing-info">
        • 용도 구성: 지하(주차장), 저층(상업), 중층(오피스), 고층(호텔, 주거, 전망대)<br>
        • 구조 시스템: 메가 컬럼 + 아웃리거 (추정)<br>
        • 코어: 철근콘크리트 전단벽 (추정)<br>
        • 주요 층: 117-123층 전망대 (서울스카이)
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section design-stages">
    <h2>설계 발전 단계</h2>
    <div class="stage-buttons">
      <button class="stage-btn active" data-stage="0">초기 매스</button>
      <button class="stage-btn" data-stage="1">형태 발전</button>
      <button class="stage-btn" data-stage="2">테이퍼링</button>
      <button class="stage-btn" data-stage="3">곡선 적용</button>
      <button class="stage-btn" data-stage="4">최종 형태</button>
    </div>
    <div class="stage-description" id="stageDesc">
      <strong>1단계: 초기 매스 스터디</strong><br><br>
      기본적인 수직 매스를 설정합니다. 555m 높이의 초고층 건물로서 기본 비율과 대지 내 배치를 검토합니다. 
      이 단계에서는 단순한 직육면체 형태로 전체 볼륨을 파악합니다.
      <br><br>
      <em>※ 이는 공개 자료를 바탕으로 한 개념적 재구성이며, 실제 설계 과정과 다를 수 있습니다.</em>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section model-viewer">
    <h2>3D 모델 뷰어</h2>
    <div class="controls">
      <button class="control-btn" id="resetView">시점 초기화</button>
      <button class="control-btn" id="toggleRotate">자동 회전</button>
    </div>
    <canvas id="viewer3d"></canvas>
    <div class="legend">
      <div class="legend-item">
        <div class="legend-color" style="background: #4a90e2;"></div>
        <span>저층부 (상업시설)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="legend-item">
        <div class="legend-color" style="background: #7b68ee;"></div>
        <span>중층부 (오피스텔)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="legend-item">
        <div class="legend-color" style="background: #ff6b6b;"></div>
        <span>고층부 (호텔/주거)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="legend-item">
        <div class="legend-color" style="background: #ffd93d;"></div>
        <span>최상층 (전망대)</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script src="../runtime/three-runtime.js"></script>
<script>
// Drawing functions
function drawSitePlan() {
  const canvas = document.getElementById('sitePlan');
  const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
  const w = canvas.width = canvas.offsetWidth * 2;
  const h = canvas.height = canvas.offsetHeight * 2;
  ctx.scale(2, 2);

  ctx.fillStyle = '#e8f5e9';
  ctx.fillRect(0, 0, w, h);

  // Lake
  ctx.fillStyle = '#81d4fa';
  ctx.beginPath();
  ctx.ellipse(w/4/2, h/2/2, w/6/2, h/3/2, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2);
  ctx.fill();

  // Tower footprint
  ctx.fillStyle = '#424242';
  ctx.fillRect(w/2/2 - 30, h/2/2 - 30, 60, 60);

  // Surrounding buildings
  ctx.fillStyle = '#bdbdbd';
  ctx.fillRect(w/1.5/2, h/3/2, 40, 40);
  ctx.fillRect(w/1.3/2, h/1.5/2, 35, 35);

  // Labels
  ctx.fillStyle = '#000';
  ctx.font = '10px sans-serif';
  ctx.fillText('석촌호수', w/4/2 - 20, h/2/2);
  ctx.fillText('롯데월드타워', w/2/2 - 35, h/2/2 + 50);
  ctx.fillText('N ↑', w - 30, 20);

  // Scale
  ctx.strokeStyle = '#000';
  ctx.lineWidth = 2;
  ctx.beginPath();
  ctx.moveTo(20, h/2 - 20);
  ctx.lineTo(70, h/2 - 20);
  ctx.stroke();
  ctx.fillText('0    50m', 20, h/2 - 25);
}

function drawFloorPlan() {
  const canvas = document.getElementById('floorPlan');
  const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
  const w = canvas.width = canvas.offsetWidth * 2;
  const h = canvas.height = canvas.offsetHeight * 2;
  ctx.scale(2, 2);

  ctx.fillStyle = '#fff';
  ctx.fillRect(0, 0, w, h);

  const cx = w/2/2, cy = h/2/2;
  const radius = 80;

  // Outer curved shape
  ctx.strokeStyle = '#000';
  ctx.lineWidth = 3;
  ctx.beginPath();
  for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) {
    const angle = (i / 8) * Math.PI * 2;
    const r = radius + Math.sin(i * 3) * 10;
    const x = cx + Math.cos(angle) * r;
    const y = cy + Math.sin(angle) * r;
    if (i === 0) ctx.moveTo(x, y);
    else ctx.lineTo(x, y);
  }
  ctx.closePath();
  ctx.stroke();

  // Core
  ctx.fillStyle = '#9e9e9e';
  ctx.fillRect(cx - 25, cy - 25, 50, 50);

  // Elevators
  ctx.fillStyle = '#fff';
  for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) {
    ctx.fillRect(cx - 20 + i * 15, cy - 20, 10, 10);
  }

  // Columns
  ctx.fillStyle = '#000';
  const colPositions = [
    [cx - 50, cy - 50], [cx + 50, cy - 50],
    [cx - 50, cy + 50], [cx + 50, cy + 50]
  ];
  colPositions.forEach(([x, y]) => {
    ctx.beginPath();
    ctx.arc(x, y, 4, 0, Math.PI * 2);
    ctx.fill();
  });

  // Labels
  ctx.font = '9px sans-serif';
  ctx.fillText('코어', cx - 12, cy + 3);
  ctx.fillText('임대 공간', cx + 30, cy - 40);

  // Dimensions
  ctx.strokeStyle = '#666';
  ctx.lineWidth = 1;
  ctx.setLineDash([3, 3]);
  ctx.beginPath();
  ctx.moveTo(cx - radius, h/2 - 10);
  ctx.lineTo(cx + radius, h/2 - 10);
  ctx.stroke();
  ctx.setLineDash([]);
  ctx.fillText('~50m (추정)', cx - 25, h/2 - 15);
}

function drawElevation() {
  const canvas = document.getElementById('elevation');
  const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
  const w = canvas.width = canvas.offsetWidth * 2;
  const h = canvas.height = canvas.offsetHeight * 2;
  ctx.scale(2, 2);

  ctx.fillStyle = '#e3f2fd';
  ctx.fillRect(0, 0, w, h);

  const baseW = 100;
  const topW = 40;
  const buildingH = h/2 - 40;
  const cx = w/2/2;

  // Tower silhouette with taper
  const gradient = ctx.createLinearGradient(0, h/2 - 20, 0, 20);
  gradient.addColorStop(0, '#4a90e2');
  gradient.addColorStop(0.4, '#7b68ee');
  gradient.addColorStop(0.7, '#ff6b6b');
  gradient.addColorStop(1, '#ffd93d');

  ctx.fillStyle = gradient;
  ctx.beginPath();
  ctx.moveTo(cx - baseW/2, h/2 - 20);
  ctx.lineTo(cx - topW/2, 20);
  ctx.lineTo(cx + topW/2, 20);
  ctx.lineTo(cx + baseW/2, h/2 - 20);
  ctx.closePath();
  ctx.fill();

  // Floor lines
  ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(255,255,255,0.3)';
  ctx.lineWidth = 1;
  for (let i = 0; i < 25; i++) {
    const y = h/2 - 20 - (i * buildingH / 25);
    const leftX = cx - baseW/2 + (baseW - topW) / 2 * (i / 25);
    const rightX = cx + baseW/2 - (baseW - topW) / 2 * (i / 25);
    ctx.beginPath();
    ctx.moveTo(leftX, y);
    ctx.lineTo(rightX, y);
    ctx.stroke();
  }

  // Ground
  ctx.fillStyle = '#795548';
  ctx.fillRect(0, h/2 - 20, w/2, 20);

  // Height annotation
  ctx.fillStyle = '#000';
  ctx.font = '11px sans-serif';
  ctx.fillText('555m', cx + baseW/2 + 10, h/4);
  ctx.strokeStyle = '#000';
  ctx.lineWidth = 1;
  ctx.beginPath();
  ctx.moveTo(cx + baseW/2 + 5, 20);
  ctx.lineTo(cx + baseW/2 + 5, h/2 - 20);
  ctx.stroke();

  // Level markers
  ctx.font = '8px sans-serif';
  ctx.fillText('123F', cx - baseW/2 - 25, 25);
  ctx.fillText('1F', cx - baseW/2 - 20, h/2 - 20);
}

function drawSection() {
  const canvas = document.getElementById('section');
  const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
  const w = canvas.width = canvas.offsetWidth * 2;
  const h = canvas.height = canvas.offsetHeight * 2;
  ctx.scale(2, 2);

  ctx.fillStyle = '#fff';
  ctx.fillRect(0, 0, w, h);

  const baseW = 90;
  const topW = 35;
  const buildingH = h/2 - 50;
  const cx = w/2/2;
  const baseY = h/2 - 30;

  // Underground
  ctx.fillStyle = '#d7ccc8';
  ctx.fillRect(cx - baseW/2, baseY, baseW, 20);

  // Building sections
  const sections = [
    { height: 0.15, color: '#4a90e2', label: '상업' },
    { height: 0.35, color: '#7b68ee', label: '오피스' },
    { height: 0.35, color: '#ff6b6b', label: '호텔/주거' },
    { height: 0.15, color: '#ffd93d', label: '전망대' }
  ];

  let currentY = baseY;
  sections.forEach((section, idx) => {
    const sectionH = buildingH * section.height;
    const progress = (buildingH - (currentY - (baseY - buildingH))) / buildingH;
    const currentW = baseW - (baseW - topW) * progress;
    const nextProgress = (buildingH - (currentY - sectionH - (baseY - buildingH))) / buildingH;
    const nextW = baseW - (baseW - topW) * nextProgress;

    ctx.fillStyle = section.color;
    ctx.beginPath();
    ctx.moveTo(cx - currentW/2, currentY);
    ctx.lineTo(cx - nextW/2, currentY - sectionH);
    ctx.lineTo(cx + nextW/2, currentY - sectionH);
    ctx.lineTo(cx + currentW/2, currentY);
    ctx.closePath();
    ctx.fill();

    ctx.fillStyle = '#000';
    ctx.font = '9px sans-serif';
    ctx.fillText(section.label, cx + currentW/2 + 5, currentY - sectionH/2);

    currentY -= sectionH;
  });

  // Core
  ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(0,0,0,0.3)';
  ctx.fillRect(cx - 8, baseY - buildingH, 16, buildingH);

  // Ground line
  ctx.strokeStyle = '#000';
  ctx.lineWidth = 2;
  ctx.beginPath();
  ctx.moveTo(cx - baseW/2 - 20, baseY);
  ctx.lineTo(cx + baseW/2 + 20, baseY);
  ctx.stroke();

  ctx.font = '8px sans-serif';
  ctx.fillStyle = '#000';
  ctx.fillText('지상', cx + baseW/2 + 25, baseY);
  ctx.fillText('지하', cx + baseW/2 + 25, baseY + 15);
}

// Initialize drawings
drawSitePlan();
drawFloorPlan();
drawElevation();
drawSection();

// Three.js 3D Model
const scene = new THREE.Scene();
scene.background = new THREE.Color(0x0a0a1a);

const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(50, 1, 0.1, 2000);
camera.position.set(300, 400, 500);

const canvas3d = document.getElementById('viewer3d');
const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas: canvas3d, antialias: true });

function resizeRenderer() {
  const parent = canvas3d.parentElement;
  const width = parent.clientWidth;
  const height = parent.clientHeight;
  renderer.setSize(width, height);
  camera.aspect = width / height;
  camera.updateProjectionMatrix();
}
resizeRenderer();
window.addEventListener('resize', resizeRenderer);

const controls = new THREE.OrbitControls(camera, renderer.domElement);
controls.enableDamping = true;
controls.dampingFactor = 0.05;

// Lighting
const ambientLight = new THREE.AmbientLight(0xffffff, 0.5);
scene.add(ambientLight);

const directionalLight1 = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff, 0.8);
directionalLight1.position.set(100, 200, 100);
scene.add(directionalLight1);

const directionalLight2 = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0x4a90e2, 0.4);
directionalLight2.position.set(-100, 100, -100);
scene.add(directionalLight2);

// Ground
const groundGeometry = new THREE.CircleGeometry(400, 32);
const groundMaterial = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0x1a3a2e, side: THREE.DoubleSide });
const ground = new THREE.Mesh(groundGeometry, groundMaterial);
ground.rotation.x = -Math.PI / 2;
ground.position.y = -5;
scene.add(ground);

// Grid
const gridHelper = new THREE.GridHelper(800, 40, 0x3fc1c9, 0x2a5a6a);
gridHelper.position.y = -4;
scene.add(gridHelper);

let currentTower = null;
let autoRotate = false;

// Stage descriptions
const stageDescriptions = [
  {
    title: '1단계: 초기 매스 스터디',
    text: '기본적인 수직 매스를 설정합니다. 555m 높이의 초고층 건물로서 기본 비율과 대지 내 배치를 검토합니다. 이 단계에서는 단순한 직육면체 형태로 전체 볼륨을 파악합니다.'
  },
  {
    title: '2단계: 형태 발전',
    text: '건물의 기본 형태를 발전시킵니다. 구조적 효율성과 바람 하중을 고려하여 상부로 갈수록 단면적을 줄이는 방향을 검토합니다. 이 단계에서 전체적인 비례와 스카이라인 기여도를 평가합니다.'
  },
  {
    title: '3단계: 테이퍼링 적용',
    text: '상부로 갈수록 좁아지는 테이퍼링을 본격적으로 적용합니다. 이는 구조적 안정성을 높이고 바람의 영향을 줄이며, 시각적으로도 역동적인 형태를 만듭니다. 층별로 단면적이 점진적으로 감소합니다.'
  },
  {
    title: '4단계: 곡선 적용 (한국 도자기 모티브)',
